4	 * Generates causal attention masks for hybrid attention (full + sliding window).
5	 * Output: int16 tensors (0=unmasked/False, 1=masked/True), converted to bool in wrapper.
6	 * Uses int16_t because AscendC Duplicate API does not support uint8_t.
7	 * Supported dtypes for Duplicate: half, bfloat16_t, int16_t, uint16_t, int32_t, uint32_t, float.
